Substructure Mask Explanation (SME)
  rationale/attribution/decompose.py
  Wu et al., "Chemistry-intuitive explanation of graph neural networks for
  molecular property prediction with substructure masking",
  Nature Communications 14, 2585 (2023).
  https://github.com/wzxxxx/Substructure-Mask-Explanation
  The functional-group SMARTS definitions and two helpers are ported from
  their build_data.py; the ported blocks are marked inline. The rest of
  rationale/attribution/ is ours, written with reference to their
  implementation.

